  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "“Bank Melli Iran” is one of the first banks opened in the republic and it offers a wide range of services to customers in the banking market of Azerbaijan for 28 years. Our bank is insured against all financial risks as a Branch Office of the State Bank of the Islamic Republic of Iran."
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "“Bank Melli Iran”, Baku Branch treat each customer individually. According to the banking license obtained from the Central Bank, we provide services to individuals in the following types of activity:"
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "html": "Attraction of demand and term deposits (savings) and other repayable funds;<br>Granting loans;<br>Opening accounts for individuals;<br>Provision of settlement – cash services, transfer of cash, securities and payment;<br>Plastic cards;<br>Other"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Plastic Cards"
  },
